  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of Trainers (TOT) for Village Based Agents (VBAs) - Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of Trainers (TOT) for Village Based Agents (VBAs) - Kenya
CARE Kenya will be training Village Based Agents working with Diageo in Kenya on the global curriculum for smallholders farmers developed by CARE Kenya.
The modules they will be trained on are:
- agri business
- financial literacy and management
- gender and social norms community dialogues
- Women voices and leadership</narrative>
  </description>
